'''Lapis Lazuli''' (usually known as '''Lapis''') is a {{Common}} vanilla item obtained via {{skill|mining}} with at least {{stat|BP|2}}. It can be collected in {{zone|Lapis Quarry}}, {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}} by mining {{Item|Lapis Lazuli Ore}}. The main use for mining Lapis Lazuli is getting XP levels, as it drops many experience orbs.

== Collection ==
Collecting lapis lazuli increases the player's lapis lazuli [[Collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of lapis lazuli.
{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Lapis Lazuli}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Natural Generation ===
'''Lapis Lazuli''' is obtained by mining the {{Item|Lapis Lazuli Ore}}s found in {{zone|Lapis Quarry}}, {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. Mining {{Item|Lapis Lazuli Ore}} grants {{SkillXP|+7 Mining}}.

