== Bugs ==
*The [[Mining#Spelunker|Spelunker]] perk from the {{skill|Mining}} Skill does not apply to Lapis Lazuli, regardless of how it was mined or where it was found. The reason is currently unknown, but may be related to the fact that [[Ore|Lapis Ore]] drops multiple items by default.
*The {{Item|Andesite Whetstone|text=Refined}} reforge on pickaxe give the player {{Item|Enchanted Ink Sac}} instead of {{Item|Enchanted Lapis Lazuli}}. It is linked to the fact that the Lapis Lazuli is a Dye with a damage value of 4 and the Ink Sac a Dye with a damage value of 0. Receiving an Enchanted Ink Sac this way increase the [[Ink Sac|Ink Sac Collection]].

== Trivia ==
* '''Lapis Lazuli''' was one of the first collections to have a level 10 crafting recipe.

